TITLE 1D transport, 10 cells 10 shifts, cation exchange
SOLUTION 0  Initial
    pH 7.0
    pe 10.733
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
SOLUTION 1-10
    pH 7.0
    pe 10.733
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
SOLUTION 11  Influent
    pH 7.0
    pe 10.733
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -dispersivities 0
    -punch_frequency 1
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -step true
    -state true
    -solution true
    -pe true
END
